<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - July 18.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - July 18.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1415 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 pct protein to STAG Oct/Dec 109.50</p>
<p>Liverpool Jul 127.50</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Norfolk/Suffolk Jul 82.00 asa 81.00</p>
<p>West Norfolk Jul 81.00 asa 79.00</p>
<p>Southampton asa 80.00</p>
<p>Avon range Jul 81.00 Sep 81.00 Oct/Dec 87.00</p>
<p>West Devon Jul 83.50</p>
<p>Tilbury asa 80.00 Sep 82.00 Oct/Dec 87.00</p>
<p>Feed barley to Norfolk/Suffolk asa 75.00</p>
<p>South Humberside asa 75.50</p>
<p>Tilbury spot 75.00/77.00</p>
<p>Avon range Oct/Dec 83.50 Jan/Mar 86.50</p>
</text>
